  "name": "vulkan-zig-renderer",
  "description": "A low-level graphics engine prototype implemented in Zig, utilizing Vulkan for hardware-accelerated rendering and GLFW for windowing. It features a custom dynamic procedure loading system for Vulkan commands and a specialized device memory management layer via a FixedBufferAllocator. The architecture focuses on explicit control over graphics pipeline state, swapchain synchronization, and memory-aligned vertex data structures.",
